\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. \cf0  All parents listen to Jesus
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 Suffer children to come to me
\par Do not restrain them to come forth
\par Allow them to come thither now
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2.  Because it is for these children
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 That the Kingdom belongs to them
\par  What's all these worldly things about?
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0\qj  Can they compare with heavenly deeds?
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3.  The heavenly Kingdom will remain
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0  Jesus will come with His teachings
\par To pave the way to lead you there
\par  You'll get blessing both here and there
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4.   Bring your children forth to Jesus
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0  For, they belong to Him from birth
\par  And in the congregational band
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0\qj  They will be shown the way to heav'n.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 5.   If you really love your children
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0\qj  You'll bring them forth to Him on time
\par \pard\li270\sl190\slmult0\qj  Those who are not His real children
\par  He loves them not, but He hates them
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li270\sl190\slmult0\qj\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 6\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 6.  What are these worldly treasures for?
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0\qj  For that is what pollute their hearts
\par  Jesus takes good care of them all
\par  He surrenders them to the Lord.
\par \pard\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2\fs14 
\par }

